            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1969] Can not switch visualization package version</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1969</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In case of there&apos;re multiple versions of a visualization package in npm repository, Zeppelin helium menu allows user select specific version.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;However, switching version sometimes result &apos;npm install&apos; command failure (internally). And visualization bundle can not be rebuilt.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
